# Tape Vault: Spine league, track 3. Two tape vaults side by side and a
# figure of eight that never crosses: from the line along the top of the
# left vault the lap drops into the waist, climbs into the right vault,
# runs down its east wall (which bows in like a reel), comes back through
# the waist the other way and around the left vault, whose west wall bows
# in too. The two waist hairpins nearly touch across the middle of the
# map. Hot spots in both vaults, overclock pads on the top-left and
# bottom-right straights. Control point 0 is the start line; features on
# point i apply to the segment from point i to i+1.
league spine
width 52
# x    y    half   features
 250  120   50     pad             # start line, east along the top of the left vault; pad
 370  130   50
 430  220   48
 440  330   48                     # down into the waist
 475  405   48
 550  405   48
 585  330   48                     # and up into the right vault
 595  220   48
 650  130   50
 790  120   50     hot:2
 880  230   50
 870  360   50
 740  510   50                     # the east wall bows in
 870  660   50
 880  790   50
 800  890   50     pad             # along the bottom of the right vault
 660  880   48
 590  790   48
 580  690   48                     # up into the waist
 545  620   48
 475  620   48
 440  690   48                     # and down into the left vault
 430  790   48
 360  890   50
 230  890   50     hot:2
 140  790   50
 150  660   50
 280  510   50                     # the west wall bows in
 150  360   50
 160  190   50
